*Calculating Churn
Created new column called "Churned". This column changed the "Churn Label" column from yes or no, to yes = 1 and no = 0.
Churned = IF('Databel - Data'[Churn Label] = "Yes", 1,0)
A new measure was created to count the number of churned customers
Number of Churned Customers = COUNT('Databel - Data'[Churned])
Churn Rate = DIVIDE(
    SUM('Databel - Data'[Churned]),
    COUNTROWS('Databel - Data'),
    0
)*100

